(e) Name of the subscriber (whose public key the Certificate identifies); and
(f) Public Key information of the subscriber.

27.
Archival of Digital Signature Certificate.
- A Certifying Authority shall archive-
(a)
applications for issue of Digital Signature Certificates;
(b)
registration and verification documents of generated Digital Signature Certificates;
(c)
Digital Signature Certificates;
(d)
